! _POC-XRLDPD RT03(IOL・予備経路の P・BGP なし)。LDP は有効(パスワードは PoC の段で足す)。
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
mpls ldp neighbor 10.255.0.12 password LDP-CORE-7
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.13 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description BACKUP to XR01
 ip address 10.0.3.13 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 100
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description to RT02
 ip address 10.0.23.13 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 100
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0013.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
